1
00:00:15,024 --> 00:00:18,764
On prend un kilo de pommes et un litre de lait ?
Shall we get a kilogram of apples and a liter of milk?

2
00:00:18,864 --> 00:00:24,020
Oui. La moitié des pommes est pour la tarte.
Yes. Half of the apples are for the tart.

3
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:28,340
La plupart des clients achètent autant de pommes que nous.
Most customers buy as many apples as we do.

4
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:33,164
Moi, j’en voudrais davantage, s’il te plaît.
I’d like more, please.

5
00:00:33,264 --> 00:00:36,860
Il n’y a aucun fromage dans le sac.
There’s no cheese in the bag.

6
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:41,012
Ce n’est rien, on peut acheter un morceau.
That’s all right; we can buy a piece.

7
00:00:41,112 --> 00:00:44,156
Chacun porte un sac ?
Will each of us carry a bag?

8
00:00:44,256 --> 00:00:47,972
Oui, et prends aussi un litre d’eau.
Yes, and get a liter of water too.
